    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not really about \"healing\" though. you can't un-ring a bell. the damage is done and there's no amount of \"small steps\" that fixes the fact that i'm just a person who causes harm. it feels like i'm a poison to everyone around me. how do you even move past being someone who is just... objectively bad?",
