      "content": "but what if some things just can't be corrected? like, i look at the damage and i realize that \"doing better\" doesn't actually undo the harm i caused. it feels like i'm just a parasite that keeps existing while the people i hurt have to carry the consequences. if you knew you were fundamentally toxic, wouldn't it be more compassionate to just... stop being a problem for everyone?",
